\set ECHO none
--- part 1: the child check
MATCH SIMPLE, (lu 10, NULL) present | ok
MATCH SIMPLE, (NULL, es 20) present | ok
MATCH SIMPLE, (lu 30, NULL) present | ok
MATCH SIMPLE, (lu 99, NULL) is partly NULL, accepted as natively | ok
MATCH SIMPLE, (lu 10, es 20) absent | 23503: insert or update on table "rxk.note" violates foreign key constraint "note_xor_fk"
MATCH FULL, (lu 10, NULL) partly NULL | 23503: insert or update on table "rxk.tag" violates foreign key constraint "tag_xor_fk"
MATCH FULL, (NULL, NULL) | ok
notes | 1,2,3,4
--- part 2: MATCH SIMPLE ignores keys with a NULL column, as natively
one of two rows of (lu 10) deleted, notes | 1,2,3,4
last row of (lu 10) deleted, notes | 1,2,3,4
last row of (es 20) deleted, notes | 1,2,3,4
--- part 3: integrity
check_integrity | ok
